.CORRECTION
    Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> Network >> 
    Network Connections >> "Prohibit use of Internet Connection Sharing on your DNS domain network" to "Enabled".
    Then rescan with Tenable ("Suad-VM-Test DISA STIG scan (Win 11)") and confirm WN11-CC-000044 shows Passed.

